Article 15 (Delegation of Authority) Pursuant to Article 37 (1) of the Statistics Act and Article 51 (1) of the Enforcement Decree thereof, the Administrator of the National Data Agency delegates the following authority concerning the Mining and Manufacturing Survey to the Special Metropolitan City Mayor, Metropolitan City Mayor, Special Self-Governing City Mayor, Do Governor, or Special Self-Governing Province Governor: <Amended on October 5, 2015; October 1, 2025>
1. Recruitment, employment, education and training, management, and issuance of identification cards for survey personnel;
2. Distribution, receipt, collection, and submission of survey forms;
3. Review, verification, and supplementation of survey forms;
4. Input, processing, and submission of survey data;
5. Guidance, supervision, and publicity concerning survey affairs.
